            <t torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="361" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:37,692</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:40,709</end-time>
                <translation>但反过来说 批评这种不当言论是不是也是在宣泄压力呢</translation>
                <original>ただ逆にそれも含めてガス抜きなのか</original>
